  "question": {
    "text": "What time in sec is required for depositing all the silver present in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>125</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>ml</mi></math> of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>AgNO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></math> solution by passing a current of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>241</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>25</mn></math>&nbsp;A (Given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>96500</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi></math>)"
  },
